      "text": "Create a full-body character-canon source asset with a genuine transparent background. Image1 is the accepted original adult explorer identity; image2 is her selected outfit on a dress form. Draw that SAME woman, clearly in her early thirties, wearing that olive field jacket with high collar over a dark tank top, practical brown belt/pouches, sturdy trousers, lace-up boots and canvas shoulder satchel. Keep her short asymmetric dark-teal bob, one silver streak at HER LEFT temple, amber eyes and small scar through HER LEFT eyebrow.\nNeutral relaxed standing pose facing the viewer in slight three-quarter turn; arms relaxed slightly away from body so both hands and the outer silhouette are legible; adult natural proportions. Full head-to-toe, feet and hair entirely inside a 2:3 portrait canvas with margins. Clean contemporary anime drawing, precise hands and boots, painterly soft shading, soft even frontal light. Character only, isolated alpha; no floor, shadow puddle, border, stand, mannequin, text, lettering, watermark, logo, UI or extra person. This is an original illustrative input asset, not a demonstration of a local model.",
